WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.800
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.130
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.630
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.720
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.770
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.210
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:50.150
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.980
Come with me

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.310
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:03.550
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.120
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.750
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.460
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.070
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.390
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.840
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.060
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.860
Hurry up, Takao! The fight of the D-Block is about to start!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:53.010
Come on! I don't even have time to <i>eat</i> first?

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.060
W-What a shocking outcome!

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:05.880
One of the contestants defeated twenty opponents all by himself!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.520
What?!

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:15.360
Rei Kon, a contestant from China specially admitted to this tourney, is the winner of the D-Block!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.270
The fighters of the semi finals have been decided!

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:23.640
The first match will be Max Mizuhara versus Kai Hiwatari!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.430
The second match will be Takao Kinomiya versus Rei Kon!

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:34.060
Rei Kon..? So you'll be up against him in the semi-finals.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:47.160
I couldn't even see what was happening...

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:49.060
Ah, shucks.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.020
Takao..?

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.790
I can't wait to face him!

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.690
I wonder what fighting style that guy will use.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.370
Rei Kon... Who <i>is</i> he really?

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:12.320
Clash! Max vs Kai

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.000
Oh, you don't look too worried about this!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.310
I have no reason to! No problem!

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:21.400
You'll be fighting Kai in the
semi finals. Do your best, Max!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:26.030
Kai is a tough one. But be sure to beat him and wait for me at the finals!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.810
I'll be there in a flash!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.520
Of course! No matter how strong the opponent is, I'll defeat them!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.390
Takao, it's a promise!

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:34.060
Alright!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:36.890
That's the spirit!

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:38.940
Ah, Max!

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:39.610
What?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.110
Take this with you.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.940
T-This is Mom's...

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.370
That's right, that's your Mother's pendant.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.850
Keep it as a good luck charm.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.090
Daddy!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:54.870
Mama...

00:03:55.760 --> 00:04:02.050
The first match of the semi finals—Max Mizuhara vs Kai Hiwatari—is about to begin.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.160
After the battles are over let's go to the hot springs!
Will the contestants enter the stadium.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.560
Hey, Kai!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.420
Let's both do our best!

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.190
How long will you be able to smile like that?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:21.700
What?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.470
What's <i>his</i> problem?!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.130
Do your best!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:45.060
Max! Don't you dare lose to him!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.480
The defensive Max against the aggressive Kai...

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:52.720
I'm sure this will be a high-level battle.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.360
I'll be able to gather all sorts of data.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.240
Built to host this first match of the semi finals,

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:05.460
is this Special Stage!

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.610
That's one weirdly-shaped stadium.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:27.350
If you manage to get your Beyblade in the central position and stay there to the count of ten, you get one point.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.860
The rules are easy, aren't they?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.710
"Get your Beyblade in the central position?!"

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.630
That's easy for you to say!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.490
After all, your Beyblade would wander around and fly out.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:45.260
The battle will be a 'best out of three'. Whoever gets two points first wins.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.570
A technical and exciting stage. Just the way I like them.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.530
Watch me, Mama.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.260
Here we go with the first match.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.210
Are you ready?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:04.850
Three

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.160
Two

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:07.500
One

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.340
Let's go!

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.270
So that's his new weapon!

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.240
He completed his Protociel!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:15.560
Go... Shoot!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:24.960
Look at that! Max is going straight to the count position right from the start!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.300
He's taking the initiative!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:38.450
Kai goes on the offensive! Will Max be able to withstand Dranzer's powerful attack?

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.790
No problem!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:46.750
Wow! Not only was he able to withstand it, he's going for the top again!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.080
Max's Beyblade has impressive defensive skills!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.920
W-What just happened?!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.470
It's really interesting.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.560
That's his secret technique, the Metal Ball Defense.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.410
Metal Ball Defense?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:06.960
When the Beyblade spins, the two metal balls inside get drawn to the sides.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:12.800
Thanks to those metal balls, both balance and defence power get greatly improved.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.030
Show 'em what you've got, Protociel!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:20.080
He's resisting Dranzer's consecutive attacks!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.000
What amazing defense!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.830
Wow! He's the perfect defender!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.600
So this must be the source of Max's confidence.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.610
An impressive mechanism!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.860
Max got into count position!

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.350
And here's the count!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:34.890
One

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:36.100
Two

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.880
Alright! I'm getting the first point!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:39.940
Three

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:42.560
Four

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:44.820
Five

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.320
Oh! Dranzer is flying high up!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.330
That's Kai's secret technique!

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:55.520
The perfect defender? Don't make me laugh.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.320
Take this! Spin Fire Attack!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.600
No way! Was he aiming for this from the start?!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:14.940
Oh! It seems Dranzer's attack power was too much for Max's Beyblade defense!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.140
Then Dranzer..!

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.040
Eight

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:18.500
Nine

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.080
Ten!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.640
Dranzer takes the first point!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:29.460
"Perfect defender"... That kind
of thing doesn't matter to me.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:35.050
What destructive power! He broke right through that incredible defense!

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.220
Max...

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:42.430
I can't believe it... The
Metal Ball Defense didn't work...

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:45.060
No..! What can I do now?

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.170
Hey! Max!

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:50.970
You're going to fight me in the finals, remember?

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.980
I won't forgive you if you break our promise!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.980
Can you hear me? Max!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.530
Takao...

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:04.350
That's right. I made a promise with Takao.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.980
This is no time to lose spirit!

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:15.490
Still, I'm going to need a greater defense to face that attack power.

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:19.430
What can I do against that
powerful rotation-based attack?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:20.710
Rotation...

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:21.720
Spin...

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.340
Spin... Spin!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.700
I've got it!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.680
Second battle!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.360
This is it for you.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.610
If you come at me with big power, I will use...

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.000
Max Defense!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.740
Here we go!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.000
Three

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.100
Two

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.200
One

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.080
Go... Shoot!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.520
H-He pulled the winder in reverse?!

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.020
He pulled in reverse?!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:59.620
Max went for the center right away!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.150
I'll start the count!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.100
One

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:03.630
Two

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:07.390
He's making the Bey spin counter-clockwise! But why would he do that?

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.970
He's making it spin the opposite of Dranzer.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.620
And that means...

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.640
And that means?

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.650
What could it mean?

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:22.840
Even if you figured it out, it's too late. Yours is but a vain struggle.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:29.600
I don't have time to waste with you! My true goal lies elsewhere!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.080
I will end this with my Spin Fire Attack!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.120
W-What an incredible shockwave!

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.310
How did the clash end?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.090
Max endured Dranzer's attack!

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:50.800
But it looks like it's lost all its rotational power!

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.090
The count stops!

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:58.140
I see! Max blocked Dranzer's attack with an opposite rotation and,

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:02.780
sacrificing its own Beyblade's rotational power, stopped Dranzer's offensive!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.810
But that means..!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.740
You might have resisted Dranzer's attack,

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.180
but what can you do now that you can't spin anymore?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.330
Dranzer! Blow him away!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.060
No! Our battle starts now!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.090
What?!

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:17.570
Now! Spin, go!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.930
He absorbed Dranzer's rotational power!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:30.450
The perfect strategy for a true defender!

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.570
Wow! you're amazing, Max!

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.190
Dranzer loses its rotational power and falls!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:44.450
Max makes the count and scores a point!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:48.370
Yay! With this we're even! It's not over yet!

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:04.180
The Bit wasn't able to withstand Dranzer's attack!

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:07.090
N-No way!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:27.770
The Bit wasn't able to withstand Dranzer's attack!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:32.180
I managed to win somehow,
but what destructive power!

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:41.680
Max, hurry with your set-up. The last battle is about to start.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.990
Right away! But my Bit...

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.050
Mama's pendant!

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:50.820
This is..?

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.130
What a weird figure...

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.080
But for some reason it feels familiar.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.410
Oh, it's a perfect fit!

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:08.160
It's the final battle! Lend me your power, Mama!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:16.980
What's wrong?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.410
No, I thought I saw it shine for a moment.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.300
That Bit...

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.160
Interesting.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.500
I want to win! Lend me your power!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.660
You're not a simple Beyblade anymore, Draciel!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.740
That's right! From now on, your name will be Draciel!

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:52.060
Final battle!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:58.240
Thee, Two, One!

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.250
Go... Shoot!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.160
Let's do this, Draciel!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.520
Go, Dranzer!

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.880
Wow!

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.700
The two of them clashed together!

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:17.940
A fierce battle in the count position has just started!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.940
Max! Keep going, don't let him rest!

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:24.370
It's reckless! What can he do
against Dranzer's attack power?

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:25.760
No! I'm sure he'll be fine!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.680
Max made a promise with me!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.160
The ten count has finished!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.920
Now the winner will be the last one standing!

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:47.220
The fight moves back to the under stadium!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.840
Go, Draciel!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.300
You're better than I thought.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:59.520
But is <i>this</i> the best you can do?

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.810
Show me your <i>real</i> power.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.650
If you don't...

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.660
Fall apart!

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:16.220
Not yet! Draciel's strongest weapon is his defense!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.100
Endure it!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.220
You have to endure it!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.480
Endure it, Draciel!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.220
T-Takao! Did you see that?

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.500
Max!

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.230
I knew it.

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.760
Go, Draciel!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:55.300
To think you would be able to take Dranzer's attack...

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.180
That must be your power. Still..!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.640
It's my win! Did you see my Draciel Attack?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:13.050
Dranzer got thrown high up in the air!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.660
Heck yeah!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.330
Max! The match is already yours!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.300
No! This is..!

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.310
Alright!

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.190
Fool...

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.060
Do you still not get it?

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:24.920
What..?

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:03.010
A c-comeback victory!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:08.660
Kai wins! With this comeback victory, he earns his spot in the finals!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:13.010
Max, you did great as well! It was a superb battle!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:18.870
Max...

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:26.520
It really was a superb battle. <i>This</i> is what a Beyblade match should be like.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.830
Hey, you!

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.000
It was a really nice fight!

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.530
Your play was very very wonderful!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.910
You're a poor loser, I see.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:48.560
No, no! I fought with all I had and lost.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:51.910
It was refreshing! Today I felt super happy!

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.420
You're a naive fool.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.550
Still, this makes the third...

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.120
Mama, I lost...

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.400
I'm going to do my best the next time!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:14.900
But what in the world was <i>that</i>?

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:16.880
Takao!

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.740
Too bad about the fight, Max.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.620
Sorry, I couldn't keep our promise...

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.520
Don't worry! You did your best out there!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.950
You were awesone!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:30.630
I'm really proud to call myself your friend, you know!

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.020
Takao!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:59.480
What?! A mysterious power sealed inside the Bit?!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.810
Indeed. You saw it too, Max.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:05.920
I think that was an unknown source of tremendous energy taking physical form.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:09.630
But I'm still in the middle of analyzing it so I don't know the details.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.540
A mysterious power...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.680
Well, I know it sounds hard to believe at first.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.130
Max..?

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:28.250
A Beyblade possessing mysterious power!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.760
Very wonderful!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:32.610
Hey, Max. don't accept it right away.

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.770
He's on your level of naivete.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:40.160
Well? I bet you're envious of my Draciel now!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.280
Sorry to disappoint you, Max. You're not the only one.

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.520
Dragoon is the same.

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:51.070
Then... That thing that came
out of Kai's Dranzer too..?

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:52.390
It would appear so.

00:19:55.850 --> 00:20:01.070
Then, if both of our Beys have this mysterious power, why did I lose?

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:09.100
This is just my hypothesis, but I think you weren't used to it. You haven't mastered that power as much as Kai has.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:13.200
I see! That means I can become
a lot stronger from now on!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.260
What's wrong?

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.330
I thought I heard a noise...

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:51.270
Rei!

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.820
Those cracks on the ground..!

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:56.340
Did Rei's Bayblade cause them?!

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:01.350
If that's the case, it must have an enormous power!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.920
I can't wait to see how that guy fights.

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:16.930
Tomorrow's match can't come soon enough!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.730
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.370
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:59.580
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.110
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:33.110
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:02.500
According to my info, the identity of the mysterious opponent from China has come to light.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.540
His name is Rei Kon.

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:08.330
He controls Driger, an extremely powerful Beyblade.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:13.360
And that figure engraved on his Bit... Why, isn't that Byakko?

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:17.410
Then that means that his Beyblade too is... one of <i>them</i>!

00:23:17.940 --> 00:23:20.870
Next time: Roar! Dragoon Storm

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:24.020
Everybody, I wouldn't miss it if I were you!
